-- What the Ofek Hadash agreements state in the same words (MMS-775): each
-- such declaration is declared here once and imported by every agreement
-- that states it. Above each one is where it is stated.

IMPORT prelude

-- the wage agreement of 19.10.2022 and the agreement of 29.6.2025: a salary
-- month counted as one number, month m of year y (convention
-- dates.salary-month).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m
